  "prefLabel": "App 208.01 Role of Council Staff in Enforcement or Disciplinary Hearings",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "App 208.01 Role of Council Staff in Enforcement or Disciplinary Hearings. Unless called as witnesses, council staff shall have no role in any enforcement or disciplinary hearing.\n\nSource. #7864-A, eff 4-1-03",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/app100-500.html"
